A box holds $2$ purple counters and $2$ orange counters, so purple and orange are equally likely on each draw. A counter is drawn and its colour recorded, the counter is returned, and a second counter is drawn. What is the probability of drawing one purple counter and one orange counter, in any order, as a fraction in simplest form?

